Elmag 2 is the improved version of Alliance's
successful vehicle Elmag 1. It has better energy
accumulators which have multiplied the firepower of
this vehicle. Instead of one cannon, Elmag 2 has 2
cannons with three additional barrels. The damaging
shots are effective against all kinds of targets.
Special shells shot by this mechanism with the help of
electromagnets completely annihilate the surrounding
area. As with every other vehicle with electromagnetic
weapons the main drawback of Elmag 2 is its engine.
Thanks to newer accumulators, the Elmag 2 is more
effective than the previous version but without more
efficient engines and power generators the efforts in
improving them further is doomed to fail.~
